  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lab-LITE: Moving Dart (Developing Anti-Retroviral Treatment) Implementation Forwards Into Policy and Practice in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An implementation research project to demonstrate that delivery of antiretroviral therapy using clinical monitoring can be safely, equitably and cost-effectively decentralised in Africa and effectively rolled out.</narrative>
  </description>
